    "titleJa": "第3課 場所と位置・値段",
    "topic": "Locational demonstratives (koko/soko/asoko), asking directions, and prices",
    "status": "available",
    "description": "Learn how to ask for and describe locations, department store floors, origins of products, and item prices in yen.",
    "objectives": [
      "Ask and identify places using ここ, そこ, あそこ, and どこ",
      "Use polite directional forms こちら, そちら, あちら, and どちら",
      "Inquire where an item was manufactured or produced using どこ の N",
      "Ask prices using いくら and understand yen values"
    ],
    "vocabularyCount": 16,
    "grammarPoints": [
      "ここ / そこ / あそこ は N(place) です (Here / There is N)",
      "N1 は N2(place) です (N1 is at N2)",
      "どこ / どちら ですか (Where / Which direction is it?)",
      "N1 の N2 (Origin / Manufacturer: Where is N2 from?)",
      "いくら ですか (How much is it?)"
    ]
  },
